            "runspecmonth_rows",
            "fuelformulation_rows",
            "runspecyear_rows"
          ],
          "description": "TFG-1a's `gasPortionRVP` at the formulation's own ethanol volume -- AFTER the high-ethanol substitution, because TankFuelGenerator reads the execution database's `FuelFormulation`, in which E85 formulation 27002 carries 10 and not 74. It is NULL in MOVES where RVP or ETOHVolume is NULL, and such a formulation then contributes to the denominator of the mean and not to its numerator; `tfg_hasGasPortion` carries that."
        },
        "tfg_hasGasPortion": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
