            "runspeccounty_rows",
            "runspecmonth_rows",
            "fuelformulation_rows",
            "runspecyear_rows"
          ],
          "description": "`doAirToxicsCalculations`: the toxic's base emission times its complex-model ratio, over VOC's base emission times VOC's. Two `cmx_ratioNoSulfur` cells of the SAME formulation and the same age, at two different configurations -- which is why the VOC configuration is in the relation at all. The sulfur model is not applied: this quotient is `ratioNoSulfur` on both sides, and `atDifferenceFraction` is what the air-toxics engine computes."
        },
