            "runspecmonth_rows",
            "runspecyear_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The market-share collapse of the quotient over the county's gasoline formulations. MOVES applies the per-formulation ratio to a per-formulation emission and sums; this document collapses the ratio and applies it to the collapsed parent, which is the same number wherever a fuel type has one supplied formulation -- as it does in every run this repository reproduces -- and is the same choice the hydrocarbon species make."
        },
