          ],
          "description": "`generalFuelRatio` as BaseRateCalculator applies it to a rated pollutant-process, 1 where no row covers. A separate factor from `rt_criteriaRatio` because MOVES keeps them in separate tables and multiplies both: without it every EC cell in a fuel-effect window was off by exactly this number, 1/1.0909107 on gasoline and E85 and 1/0.9727 on diesel (`runspecs/pending/process-pm-exhaust.esm`)."
