          "description": "The operating-mode weights the rate rows are summed under: `pp_WSpeedBins` in every DEFAULT-domain run, and for a PROJECT run's running exhaust the project link's own distribution `lomd_W` -- BaseRateGenerator's core path over the RatesOpModeDistribution LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator wrote, with no average-speed weighting (baserategenerator/mod.rs:158 and :242, `!is_project`)."
