        "rfl_processID": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "refuelingloss_rows"
          ],
          "description": "THE REFUELING EDGE LIST, output side: the two processes `RefuelingLossCalculator` writes, Refueling Displacement Loss (18) and Refueling Spillage Loss (19). Both produce Total Hydrocarbons, so the pollutant is a constant and the process is the list."
        },
        "rfl_ordinal": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "refuelingloss_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The loss list's own row ordinal."
        },
        "rfp_processID": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "refuelingenergyprocess_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The edge list's input side: the exhaust processes whose Total Energy Consumption the refueling calculation chains off -- running (1), start (2), extended idle (90) and auxiliary power (91). `refueling_loss_calculator.rs`'s `ENERGY_SOURCE_PROCESS_IDS`, which is the Java `sourceProcessIDs` and the SQL's `mwo.processID IN (1, 2, 90, 91)`. It is the same four the CO2AE calculator declares and it is declared again here, because two calculators agreeing about which processes burn fuel is a coincidence of the data and not a shared constant."
        },
        "rfp_ordinal": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "refuelingenergyprocess_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The energy-process list's own row ordinal."
        },
        "rfe_lossOrdinal": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "refuelingedge_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The two losses crossed with the four energy processes, flattened so that every join key is one-dimensional (a two-dimensional key is dropped, F57). Rows 1-4 are displacement on the four processes and 5-8 are spillage."
        },
        "rfe_processOrdinal": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
