          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "hcspeciation_rows"
          ],
          "description": "hcspeciation.polProcessID: the SPECIES, 8001 NMOG or 8701 VOC, and not the NMHC it is computed from. Unlike methanethcratio this table names the pollutant-process, so its own key selects the arm.",
          "update": {
