            "runspecmonth_rows"
          ],
          "description": "The same lookup at `ff_speciationSubtypeID`: gasohol E10 for a 50/51/52 formulation and the row's own subtype for everything else. It is the complement of THIS that scales `altTHC` into the NMOG and VOC operand."
        },
        "rt_hasCh4Ratio": {
          "type": "unknown",
