          "description": "`HCSpeciation.speciationConstant` at the row's own fuel subtype, market-share weighted. The table is keyed by the SPECIES' pollutant-process -- 8001 NMOG, 8701 VOC -- so unlike the methane table its own key picks the arm and no pollutant test is needed."
