          "description": "How many `HCSpeciation` rows this row's joins reach whose `oxySpeciation` is not zero. It is 0 for every row of the national table, which is why this document carries no oxygenate term: `speciationConstant + oxySpeciation x volToWtPercentOxy x totalOxygenate` is the form (lib/adjustments.esm's `speciation_factor`) and its second summand is identically absent. Counted rather than assumed, because it is a fact about the DATA."
        },
        "rt_speciationExponentDelta": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "rate_rows",
            "runspeccounty_rows",
            "runspecmonth_rows"
