        {
          "_comment": "The tire-wear operating-mode distribution of one speed bin. avg_speed_op_mode_distribution.rs:386-420: `opModeIDTirewear` already names the mode, every emitted row carries opModeFraction = 1, and no drive schedule is consulted. The 1 arrives as a matched row of a `join.on` and the 0 as an unmatched one, so mode 400 -- which no speed bin names -- is 0 by the same mechanism that gives 401 its 1.",
          "lhs": "asb_tireModeFraction",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
