          "_comment": "J22 against `emissionrate`, the age-INDEPENDENT arm. Five key pairs: the pollutant-process and the four slots of the packed source bin."
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rt_hasRateByAge",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
