        },
        {
          "_comment": "And the rate itself, through the same selection. A rate row whose pollutant-process is age-resolved reads the age group's rate; one whose pollutant-process is not reads the single rate. `rt_hasRateByAge` is the discriminant in both, so the two lines cannot disagree about which table was used.",
          "lhs": "rtMode_rate",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
