          "_comment": "J68: `meanFuelParameters`, which is two lookups in one table. `HI` and `Intercept` have no row and need none; `E200`, `E300` and `Benzene` have a row whose `centeringValue` is NULL, which means the same thing as no row; every CO row has a NULL `stdDevValue`, which means 1 rather than 0. Three different absences, two different defaults, one join.",
