        {
          "_comment": "The model year each age category stands for in this run. The `run_rows` range carries the year; it is the same EarthSciAST#437 shape as the gathers above, except that here the value is read through an `index` rather than a join key, so a missing range would be a hard error rather than a quiet one.",
