        },
        {
          "_comment": "J74: the sulfur model. The 50/50 blend of the Normal and High emitter classes IS this aggregate -- `sulfurModelCoeff` carries one row for each and the summand is half of one arm, so the blend is the contraction and not a second expression. The model-year window is a filter over a range the group identifier encodes, and the source type is a real key here for the same reason it is a real key in the closed form.",
