              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  "rt_humidityCFR86",
                  "rt_humidityCFR1065"
                ]
              },
              1.0
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "adjust.rs:128-137. DIESEL is `(77 - T) x A` and switched off above 77 degF; every other fuel is the ordinary centred quadratic about 75. Two different reference temperatures in one branch, which is not a thing a reader guesses.",
