        {
          "_comment": "`general_temp_adjust` in adjust.rs's own branch order, minus the PM arm its description names. The EV arm is unchanged and still first of the three, so the five RunSpecs that reach only it are untouched.",
          "lhs": "rt_temperatureFactor",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": ">",
